# Godot

- Typed GDScript only. Godot 4.7 standard editor. No C# / `.csproj`. No untyped `var x =`.
- Do not Write or StrReplace `.tscn`. Scene and editor jobs go through MCP `godot-mcp-pro` (see `godot-mcp.mdc`). If MCP is down, print the checklist in `knowledge/tech/godot.md` and stop.
- Player-facing copy is `tr("KEY")` plus `locale/*.csv`. No literal UI strings.
- `src/sim/` does not use nodes or `Input.*`. It ticks `Array[InputFrame]`.
- Catalog numbers come from `web/src/data/*.json` (or a byte-identical copy). Do not fork stats.
- No Godot HTML5 export preset. itch stays the Phaser client.
- Workshop loads data only. Reject scripts and native code from packs.
- Do not add a `Game.Player` singleton. Players are `PlayerId` 0..3 even while v1 is solo.
